+<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1600" height="900" viewBox="0 0 1600 900" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc">
+  <title id="title">Teach and resume lifecycle</title><desc id="desc">Teach mode builds a map and semantic places, packages them into a session, and resume mode restores AMCL localization, Nav2, and semantic context.</desc>
+  <defs><linearGradient id="bg" x1="0" y1="0" x2="1" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#0a0d11"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#151b20"/></linearGradient><marker id="a" markerWidth="10" markerHeight="10" refX="8" refY="5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="#8dff47"/></marker><filter id="s"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="14" stdDeviation="18" flood-opacity=".35"/></filter><style>.title{font:700 44px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;fill:#f7f8f9}.sub{font:400 20px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;fill:#98a2ad}.ey{font:700 14px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;letter-spacing:2.4px;fill:#8dff47}.box{fill:#151a20;stroke:#37414b;stroke-width:2;rx:25;filter:url(#s)}.session{fill:#13261a;stroke:#67d870;stroke-width:2;rx:28}.h{font:700 23px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;fill:#f3f5f6}.p{font:400 16px -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;fill:#a8b1ba}.m{font:600 14px ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;fill:#c7d0d7}.flow{fill:none;stroke:#8dff47;stroke-width:3;marker-end:url(#a)}.gray{fill:none;stroke:#687480;stroke-width:3;stroke-dasharray:9 9}</style></defs>
+  <rect width="1600" height="900" fill="url(#bg)"/><text x="82" y="78" class="ey">PERSISTENT AUTONOMY · SESSION LIFECYCLE</text><text x="82" y="130" class="title">Teach once. Resume the same world state.</text><text x="82" y="166" class="sub">Maps, names, localization, and tours must refer to one versioned environment.</text>
+  <rect x="82" y="230" width="390" height="430" class="box"/><text x="116" y="278" class="ey">TEACH MODE</text><text x="116" y="324" class="h">SLAM owns map → odom</text><text x="116" y="358" class="p">Drive through the environment while</text><text x="116" y="384" class="p">building occupancy and semantic context.</text>
+  <rect x="116" y="425" width="322" height="72" class="box"/><text x="140" y="456" class="h">1 · Build map</text><text x="140" y="482" class="m">SLAM Toolbox + /scan + /odom</text>
+  <rect x="116" y="515" width="322" height="72" class="box"/><text x="140" y="546" class="h">2 · Name places</text><text x="140" y="572" class="m">label → pose in map frame</text>
+  <text x="116" y="626" class="p">Save only after map and semantic</text><text x="116" y="650" class="p">artifacts agree.</text>
+
+  <rect x="565" y="265" width="470" height="360" class="session"/><text x="602" y="314" class="ey">VERSIONED SESSION</text><text x="602" y="360" class="h">One directory is the unit of world state</text>
+  <rect x="602" y="402" width="180" height="60" class="box"/><text x="626" y="438" class="m">map.yaml</text><rect x="818" y="402" width="180" height="60" class="box"/><text x="842" y="438" class="m">map.pgm</text>
+  <rect x="602" y="480" width="180" height="60" class="box"/><text x="626" y="516" class="m">places.yaml</text><rect x="818" y="480" width="180" height="60" class="box"/><text x="842" y="516" class="m">session.yaml</text>
+  <text x="602" y="580" class="p">Spawn/re-entry context and tour routes remain</text><text x="602" y="605" class="p">bound to this map and place graph.</text>
+
+  <rect x="1128" y="230" width="390" height="430" class="box"/><text x="1162" y="278" class="ey">RESUME MODE</text><text x="1162" y="324" class="h">AMCL owns map → odom</text><text x="1162" y="358" class="p">Load the session, localize, validate TF,</text><text x="1162" y="384" class="p">then activate Nav2 and semantic tools.</text>
+  <rect x="1162" y="425" width="322" height="72" class="box"/><text x="1186" y="456" class="h">3 · Restore localization</text><text x="1186" y="482" class="m">map_server + AMCL</text>
+  <rect x="1162" y="515" width="322" height="72" class="box"/><text x="1186" y="546" class="h">4 · Activate autonomy</text><text x="1186" y="572" class="m">Nav2 + memory + agent + voice</text>
+  <text x="1162" y="626" class="p">Long navigation and tours run only after</text><text x="1162" y="650" class="p">the selected session is healthy.</text>
+
+  <path d="M472 445H555" class="flow"/><path d="M1035 445H1118" class="flow"/>
+  <path d="M278 680V764H1318V680" class="gray"/><text x="575" y="804" class="p">Never run SLAM and AMCL as competing map → odom publishers.</text>
+</svg>
